

# Chat Application in C

A simple TCP-based chat application developed using the C programming language and socket programming.

## Features

- Client-server communication
- Real-time message exchange
- Simple terminal interface
- TCP socket programming
- Lightweight and fast

## Technologies Used

- C Language
- Socket Programming
- TCP/IP Networking
- Linux/Unix System Calls

## Project Structure

chat-application/
│
├── main.c
├── README.md
└── Makefile

## How to Compile

Use GCC compiler:

```bash
gcc main.c -o chat
